Question 8
What is output by the code to the right? 
A)  B 
B)  B1 
C)  B12 
D)  C2 
E)  A12 
int x = 7; 
int y = 3; 
String result = ""; 

if (x > 5) 
    if (y > 5) 
        result = "A"; 
    else 
        result = "B"; 
else if (x > 3) 
    result = "C"; 
else 
    result = "D"; 

switch (result) { 
    case "A": 
    case "B": 
        result += "1"; 
    case "C": 
        result += "2"; 
        break; 
    default: 
        result += "3"; 
} 
out.println(result); 

Question 9
