we place the following loop to center the output pyramid? 
for(int j = 4; j > i; j--) { 
 out.print(" "); 
} 
A)  line 1 
B)  line 2 
C)  line 3 
D)  line 4 

for (int i=1; i<=4;i++) { 
    //line 1 
    for (int k=1; k<=2*i-1;k++) { 
        //line 2 
        out.print("*"); 
        // line 3 
    } 
    // line 4 
    out.println(); 
}

